          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most indoor mold, RMR-141 kills the growth without the damage bleach can do, and RMR-86 or Tilex clears the stains on surfaces that can handle bleach. Concrobium then keeps regrowth off wood and drywall. In occupied bedrooms and nurseries, Benefect Decon 30 is the gentlest registered choice, and outdoors Wet and Forget clears siding, roofs and decks with no scrubbing at all.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            No product lasts if the area stays wet. Find the water and fix it, keep humidity under 50 percent, and leave anything past roughly 10 square feet, any contamination in the ducts and any growth tied to sewage to a professional.
